    ('RK_SA_ARCH_2016H2_GK', 'RK_SA_ARCH_2016H2_GK_Q009', '给定关系模式R（A，B，C，D，E）、S（D，E，F，G）和π1,2,4,6（R⋈S），经过自然连接和投影运算后的属性列数分别为（9）。', 9, '单选题', '[{"key":"A","text":"9和4","scores":{"score":0}},{"key":"B","text":"7和4","scores":{"score":1}},{"key":"C","text":"9和7","scores":{"score":0}},{"key":"D","text":"7和7","scores":{"score":0}}]', '{"questionType":"单选题","sourceQuestionNo":9,"correctOptionKey":"B","explanation":"R与S进行自然连接后，结果属性集为：A,B,C,D,E,F,G。\\n投影操作后，结果为：A,B,D,F。","imageHashValues":[]}')
